8a6d8be34651e2a0f3193ce3b3dfcbaf.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of random events: rescue trapped miners, meet a pilot fishing for boots in the swamp, and more! Every adventure is full of surprises\u2014are you ready for the challenge?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.poster.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.webm?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/c435f09d38b266b726bd4758307aa57d.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to jump farther? Extract rabbit DNA! Want to hit harder? Take wolf DNA! Here, every creature is your personal \u201cgene bank.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.poster.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.webm?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to genetic modification, you can even domesticate them or ride them across the planet, becoming the alien overlord!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.poster.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.webm?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/c25879b6b81917bcfc653ced10ecf9c9.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit alien workers: farming, mining, no complaints! They\u2019re all your laborers, letting you enjoy the pleasure of being the boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.poster.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.webm?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated production line: Mine, herd, and plant during the day, craft iron and cook food at night, and serve as an alarm system before dawn! We\u2019re also preparing a multiplayer co-op system, which will be updated soon after the game launches. Gather your friends and become &quot;xeno-capitalists&quot; together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.poster.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.webm?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7e795a9f14098cbe1ecffd187982c99c.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a stall to attract traders, turning your place into the alien trade hub and the \u201cnew CBD\u201d!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.poster.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.webm?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a viral alien restaurant offering food, entertainment, and accommodation, boosting the GDP to new heights! The creative workshop will also be opened, showcasing the power of your &quot;infrastructure prowess&quot; to the entire universe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.poster.avif?t=1753344031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.webm?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.mp4?t=1753344031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In XenoHaven, start with a pickaxe, gather resources, build a shelter, recruit villagers and run a restaurant. Explore a vast, randomized world, encounter events, modify genes and upgrade your base into an automated fortress. Trade with alien merchants and build your own extraterrestrial haven!",
